ived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2025-08-21T13:02:19Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T13:06:36Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 3.6.1 stable official [b1ba98fce]\n- I don't know if this bug is present in Godot 4\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 24H2 x64 26100.4946\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe thing is, even though the Java SDK Path is specified in the editor settings (General/Export/Android/Java SDK Path), when exporting for Android, I get the error `‘apksigner’ returned with error #1`. Since there can be several reasons for this error when signing an APK (for example, an incorrect version of Android SDK Build-Tools), I decided to run Godot with `--verbose`. And that helped me. I saw that the problem was that I hadn't set up JAVA_HOME. Of course, I knew about this, because I don't like using the global system environment variable JAVA_HOME. It clutters up my system. Even when compiling a custom template, I only set JAVA_HOME for the duration of the console session. \n\nWhat is the point of specifying the path to the Java SDK in the editor settings if I still have to specify JAVA_HOME?\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n-\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n-","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109826/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}